                     <span class="b4g-svc-num">13</span>
                     <span class="b4g-svc-title">Enterprise AI Solutions</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="b4g-svc-body">AI systems designed for large-scale operations, enterprise data, and complex business workflows. Built to integrate with enterprise platforms and support long-term growth.</div>
                  <span class="b4g-svc-arrow">
                     <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
