                     <span class="b4g-svc-num">14</span>
                     <span class="b4g-svc-title">AI Avatar Development</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="b4g-svc-body">Interactive digital avatars powered by conversational AI, voice, and animation technologies. Useful for customer engagement, virtual assistants, and immersive digital experiences.</div>
                  <span class="b4g-svc-arrow">
                     <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
