                  <p>We follow a structured AI development process that includes requirement analysis, data preparation, AI model selection, development, testing, and deployment. Agile project management helps ensure transparency, faster iterations, and continuous feedback throughout the project. </p>
               </div>
            </div>
            <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
            <div class="faq-ai-item">
               <button class="faq-ai-question">
                  <span class="faq-title">How does Biz4Group ensure the security and quality of the software they develop? </span>
                  <span class="faq-btn-icon">
                     <svg class="faq-ai-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                        <path d="M12 5V19M5 12H19" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                     </svg>
                  </span>
               </button>
               <div class="faq-ai-answer">
                  <p>We follow secure development practices, strict code reviews, and thorough testing to ensure reliability and security. Our team implements data protection standards, performance testing, and quality assurance processes before deployment. </p>
               </div>
            </div>
            <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
            <div class="faq-ai-item">
               <button class="faq-ai-question">
                  <span class="faq-title">Can I hire dedicated AI developers or augment my existing team through Biz4Group services? </span>
                  <span class="faq-btn-icon">
                     <svg class="faq-ai-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                        <path d="M12 5V19M5 12H19" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                     </svg>
                  </span>
               </button>
               <div class="faq-ai-answer">
                  <p>Yes. Businesses can hire dedicated AI developers from Biz4Group to work as an extension of their internal teams. Our developers can support ongoing projects, AI product development, or team augmentation for specialized AI expertise. </p>
               </div>
            </div>
            <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
            <div class="faq-ai-item">
               <button class="faq-ai-question">
                  <span class="faq-title">Does Biz4Group offer dedicated AI developers or team augmentation services? </span>
                  <span class="faq-btn-icon">
                     <svg class="faq-ai-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                        <path d="M12 5V19M5 12H19" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                     </svg>
                  </span>
               </button>
               <div class="faq-ai-answer">
                  <p>Yes. We provide flexible engagement models including dedicated AI developers, AI development teams, and staff augmentation. This allows companies to scale their engineering teams quickly with experienced AI professionals. </p>
               </div>
            </div>
            <!-- FAQ Item 7 -->
            <div class="faq-ai-item">
               <button class="faq-ai-question">
                  <span class="faq-title">Does Biz4Group provide NDA and 24/7 post-launch support? </span>
                  <span class="faq-btn-icon">
                     <svg class="faq-ai-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                        <path d="M12 5V19M5 12H19" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                     </svg>
                  </span>
               </button>
               <div class="faq-ai-answer">
                  <p>Yes. We sign NDAs to protect client ideas, data, and intellectual property. Our team also provides post-launch support, maintenance, and monitoring to ensure AI systems continue running smoothly. </p>
               </div>
            </div>
            <!-- FAQ Item 8 -->
            <div class="faq-ai-item">
               <button class="faq-ai-question">
                  <span class="faq-title">How do you ensure that AI solutions remain adaptable to future technological changes? </span>
                  <span class="faq-btn-icon">
                     <svg class="faq-ai-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                        <path d="M12 5V19M5 12H19" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                     </svg>
                  </span>
               </button>
               <div class="faq-ai-answer">
                  <p>We design AI systems using scalable architecture, modular components, and modern AI frameworks. This allows businesses to upgrade models, integrate new technologies, and adapt solutions as AI capabilities evolve. </p>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
