<!-- Modal -->
<div class="modal fade" id="myModal" role="dialog">
	<div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-redesign">
		<!-- Modal content-->
		<div class="modal-content">
			<div class="modal-header">
				<button type="button" class="close close-global-btn" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
			</div>
			<div class="modal-body">
				<div class="row" style="margin: 0;">
					<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6" style="padding: 0;">
						<div class="modal-left-section">
							<div class="modal-left-top">
								<h2>Before You Go...</h2>
								<p>See how businesses like yours are building intelligent software with us.</p>

								<div class="modal-company-logos">
									<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/google-logo.webp" alt="Google" loading="lazy">
									<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/adobe-logo.webp" alt="Adobe" loading="lazy">
									<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/citi-logo.webp" alt="Citi" loading="lazy">
									<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/verizon-logo.webp" alt="Verizon" loading="lazy">
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="modal-testimonial-wrapper">
								<div class="modal-testimonial-carousel owl-carousel owl-theme">
									<div class="modal-testimonial-card">
										<p>Biz4Group showcased great execution & communication on a project involving many stakeholders. I’d work with them again & would highly recommend them to get the job done.</p>
										<div class="modal-testimonial-author">
											<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/contact-adobe-logo.png" alt="Doug Lee">
											<div class="modal-testimonial-author-info">
												<h6>Doug Lee</h6>
												<p>Sr. Manager, Adobe</p>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>

									<div class="modal-testimonial-card">
										<p>Amazing team! Great project management capabilities and thorough progress tracking.</p>
										<div class="modal-testimonial-author">
											<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/board-member/lilit-img.jpg" alt="lilit">
											<div class="modal-testimonial-author-info">
												<h6>Lilit Davtyan</h6>
												<p>CEO, DRHR</p>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
									<div class="modal-testimonial-card">
										<p>A very reliable, exceptional team to work with. I look forward to a continued working relationship as Biz4Group has proven to be the best developers we have ever worked with. Would trust no other developers to manage our future projects.</p>
										<div class="modal-testimonial-author">
											<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/portfolio/nextlpc/tiffinee-yancey.jpg" alt="tiffinee-yancey">
											<div class="modal-testimonial-author-info">
												<h6>Dr. Tiffinee Yancey</h6>
												<p>CEO, NextLPC</p>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
									<div class="modal-testimonial-card">
										<p>These people are awesome! Super smart, can build anything you ask, and can make coding and AI simple to explain to a non techy person like me. They built a custom AI sales coach to go along with my insurance sales training platform and we are counting to develop it. Again they are really good!</p>
										<div class="modal-testimonial-author">
											<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/portfolio/insurance-ai/george-e.jpg" alt="george-e">
											<div class="modal-testimonial-author-info">
												<h6>George E.</h6>
												<p>CEO, Trainwell AI</p>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
									<div class="modal-testimonial-card">
										<p>Thank you for the excellent work on my platform screens. The team did a great job working backwards from my needs and turning complex requirements into a clean, professional, and user-friendly design. The responsiveness to feedback, attention to detail, and alignment with the platformâ€™s vision are impressive, and the final screens provide both a strong foundation for development and a compelling showcase for partners and investors.</p>
										<div class="modal-testimonial-author">
											<img src="https://www.biz4group.com/images/cosy-joseph.webp" alt="cosy-joseph">
											<div class="modal-testimonial-author-info">
												<h6>Cosy Joseph</h6>
												<p>CEO, DATA Platform</p>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6" style="padding: 0;">
						<div class="modal-right-section">
							<h3><span>Share your vision</span> and we will connect with a customized approach for your business idea.</h3>

							<form id="send-contact-form" method="post" novalidate="novalidate">
								<div class="modal-form-flex">
									<div class="modal-form-group">
										<!-- <label for="modalName">Full Name<sup>*</sup></label> -->
										<input class="input LoNotSensitive" type="text" id="modalName" name="sName" placeholder="Enter full name" required minlength="3">
									</div>
									<div class="modal-form-group">
										<!-- <label for="modalEmail">Company Email<sup>*</sup></label> -->
										<input class="input LoNotSensitive" type="email" id="modalEmail" name="sEmail" placeholder="Enter company email" required>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="modal-form-flex">
									<div class="modal-form-group">
										<!-- <label for="modalContactNum">Phone Number<sup>*</sup></label> -->
										<input id="modalContactNum" type="tel" name="sContactNum" class="input LoNotSensitive" placeholder="Phone Number" required>
										<input type="hidden" id="modalDialCode" name="dialCode" value="">
										<input type="hidden" id="modalFullPhone" name="fullPhone" value="">
									</div>
									<div class="modal-form-group">
										<!-- <label for="modalBusinessSize">Business Size<sup>*</sup></label> -->
										<select name="sSelectVal" id="modalBusinessSize" required>
											<option value="" disabled selected>-Select Business Size-</option>
											<option value="Start-up">Start-up</option>
											<option value="Small-Scale">Small-Scale</option>
											<option value="Mid-Scale">Mid-Scale</option>
											<option value="Enterprise">Enterprise</option>
										</select>
									</div>

								</div>

								<div class="modal-form-group">
									<!-- <label for="modalMessage">Project Overview<sup>*</sup></label> -->
									<textarea class="input-textarea LoNotSensitive" id="modalMessage" name="sMessage" placeholder="Project Overview (Help us understand your needs better)" required minlength="10"></textarea>
								</div>

								<div class="modal-form-group modal-captcha-wrapper">
									<div id="captcha2" class="captcha"></div>
								</div>

